## 1. Membership level computation (levels 1-4)

File: `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java`, lines 87-103:

```java
87   /**
88    * The owner's numeric membership level, assigned on creation. It starts at 1, gains
